  "solution": "Given equation: 25 × 9 – 74 + 459 ÷ 3 = 52.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 9 and 3 **\n\nGiven: 25 × 9 – 74 + 459 ÷ 3 = 52.\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 25 × 3 – 74 + __**459 ÷ 9**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**25 × 3**__ – 74 + 51 = 52\n\n⇒ __**75**__ – 74 __**+ 51**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __126 - 74__ = 52\n\n⇒ **52 = 52**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 74 and 3 \n\nGiven: 25 × 9 – 74 + 459 ÷ 3 = 52\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 25 × 9 – 3 + __**459 ÷ 74**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**25 × 9**__ – 3 + 6.2 = 52\n\n⇒ __**225**__ – 3 **+ 6.2** = 52\n\n⇒ __231.2____ - 3__ = 52\n\n⇒ 228.2 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 25 and 74\n\nGiven: 25 × 9 – 74 + 459 ÷ 3 = 52\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 74 × 9 – 25 + __**459 ÷ 3**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**74 × 9**__ – 25 + 153 = 52\n\n⇒ __**66**____**6**__ – 25 __**+ 153**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __819 - 25__ = 52\n\n⇒ 794 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 25 and 3\n\nGiven: 25 × 9 – 74 + 459 ÷ 3 = 52\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 3 × 9 – 74 + __**459 ÷ 25**__ = 52\n\n⇒ __**3 × 9**__ – 74 + 18.36 = 52\n\n⇒ 27 – 74 + 18.36 = 52\n\n⇒ __45.36 -____ 74__ = 52\n\n⇒ -28.64 ≠ 52\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
